result_ll(g, sym, ret)} {sym}({shown})\",\n  )\n  w\n}","old_text":"/// `call WORDS SYM(ARGS)` of a function giving words (`by_words`): the\n/// words, not yet a value.\nfn call_words(\n  mut g: codegen.Gen,\n  ret: Ty,\n  sym: String,\n  args: List[codegen.V],\n) -> String {\n  shown := join(args\n    .filter(a -> codegen.has_value(a.ty))\n    .map(a -> codegen.ll(a.ty) + \" \" + a.op), \", \")\n  w := codegen.fresh(mut g, \"words\")\n  codegen.emit(\n    mut g,\n    f\"{w} = call {codegen.result_ll(g, sym, ret)} {sym}({shown})\",\n  )\n  w\n}"},{"name":"codegen.plain_want","kind":"fn","old":"65f0b195ee3c460e","new":"1ac40eda4f4675bd","interface_changed":false,"affected":[],"module":"codegen","text":"/// Whether a value of the type written `ty` (none: the value's own) is the\n/// value as it comes: neither a trait's nor a union's, which a value is\n/// boxed into (`converted`).\nfn plain_want(mut g: codegen.Gen, ty: Option[ast.TypeExpr]) -> Bool {\n  match ty {\n    Some(x) => {\n      t := codegen.lower(mut g, x)\n      !(t is check.TTrait) && !(t is check.TUnion)\n    },\n    None => true,\n  }\n}","old_text":"/// Whether a value of the type written `ty` (none: the value's own) is the\n/// value as it comes: neither a trait's nor a union's, which a value is\n/// boxed into (`converted`).\nfn plain_want(mut g: codegen.Gen, ty: Option[ast.TypeExpr]) -> Bool {\n  match ty {\n    Some(x) => {\n      t := codegen.lower(mut g, x)\n      !(t is TTrait) && !(t is TUnion)\n    },\n    None => true,\n  }\n}"},{"name":"codegen.held_words","kind":"fn","old":"1d0bf29a9de5105a","new":"a80edf5092da036c","interface_changed":true,"affected":["codegen.function","codegen.words_value","codegen.compiled_alone","codegen.call_at","codegen.call_fn_want","codegen.generate","codegen.call","codegen.entry","codegen.show","codegen.shown","codegen.equal","codegen.mock_call","codegen.session_entry","codegen.call_named","codegen.call_fn","codegen.method_call","codegen.options","codegen.clock_no